CeroSec — licence not yet chosen
================================

The licence for this mod has **not been decided yet**. The author (Konijima) is
choosing it, and this file will be replaced by the full text of that licence.

Until then, treat the work as **all rights reserved**:

- You may clone this repository, read it, run it, and play with it.
- You may open issues and pull requests; by sending a contribution you agree it
  may be released under whatever licence the author chooses for this file.
- Do **not** redistribute it, and do not reupload the mod to the Steam Workshop
  or anywhere else, without asking first.

Ask through the repository: https://github.com/Konijima/pz-cerosec

Third-party material
--------------------

Some art and sounds shipped in `common/media/` are reused rather than original.
The credit line on the Steam Workshop page names them; anything reused stays
under whatever terms it came with, and this file's licence does not extend to it.
